# Expand parallel qualification and relocated-layout regressions
Workstream-ID: lea-41
GitHub-Issue: https://github.com/Zanark/LinkedIn-EasyApply-Automaton/issues/41
Publication: PUBLIC_SAFE_PROJECTION
Source-record: Reviewed bounded CI and relocation-test request
Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: Qualify every supported test group without weakening release gates
Dependencies: lea-39

## Purpose
Expand meaningful offline regressions for the reorganized repository and run
independent quality, test and frozen-build lanes concurrently. Preserve the
tag-only publication boundary and all predecessor workstreams.

## Tasks
- [x] Cover relocated public resources, tooling roots and archive integrity.
- [x] Schedule every test group on both supported Python versions.
- [x] Use bounded isolated workers and retain per-lane diagnostic reports.
- [x] Require fictional invitation browser cases instead of silently skipping.
- [x] Block release publication on any failed, cancelled or skipped prerequisite.
- [ ] Qualify the exact workflow and reconcile only this workstream's tracking.

## Acceptance criteria
- [x] Every collected test file belongs to a scheduled matrix group.
- [x] Actual schema/tutorial/configuration behavior works outside the checkout cwd.
- [x] Fictional private/excluded payloads cannot produce release archives.
- [ ] All bundled bytes, manifest entries and published checksums agree.
- [ ] All independent qualification lanes must succeed before a tag publishes.
- [ ] Local and exact-source hosted results are recorded distinctly.
- [ ] Private inputs, independent applications and prior tracking are preserved.

## Completion evidence
The full fictional offline suite passes locally: 1,081 cases with two workers
and file-scoped scheduling, including required invitation browser fixtures.
Ruff, Black and mypy over 74 source files pass. The actual barrier is exercised
against missing, unexpected, failed, cancelled and skipped results.
All forty predecessor issue and Project records/timestamps are independently
preserved after adopting only lea-41 and lea-42. Hosted qualification and
release integrity remain pending; no live LinkedIn or human acceptance is claimed.

## Completion log
- 2026-11-12: Begin the separately requested parallel CI and relocation coverage.
  Keep tests fictional, hosted permissions minimal and local workers bounded.
